        <briefdescription>
<para>Hash for the actual operands ordering. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Used to count operands, actually their position id and opcode value. It is used in the voting mechanism to find the lane with the least number of operands that can freely move about or less profitable because it already has the most optimal set of operands. Can be replaced with <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_small_vector" kindref="compound">SmallVector&lt;unsigned&gt;</ref> instead but hash code is faster and requires less memory. </para>
